{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>כחלק</b> (as a portion) — Two times in the Masorah: חלק כחלק (a portion as a portion), יאכלו כחלק (they shall eat as a portion), היושב על הכלים (who sits over the vessels). From היושב על הכלים we infer: a priest with a blemish receives a portion in the holy offerings even though he is disqualified for the avodah, because he sits over the vessels."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:58.348984212Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}